---
const fragments = [
  "a fountain",
  "a dark tile floor",
  "a department-store sign",
  "a hotel tower",
  "a theater seen from a car",
  "Sade in a ceiling speaker",
  "TRON’s Grid",
  "a dream circuit",
  "Drago’s training hall",
  "a city becoming a microchip",
];
---

<figure class="memory-set article-wide not-prose">
  <header>
    <span>Reconstruction, not replay</span>
    <h3>Memory keeps rebuilding the set</h3>
  </header>
  <div class="memory-set__fragments">
    {fragments.map((fragment, index) => <span style={`--i:${index}`}>{fragment}</span>)}
  </div>
  <div class="memory-set__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
  <div class="memory-set__result">
    <small>COMPOSITE LOCATION</small>
    <strong>A mall that never had one real address</strong>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Dream studies do not prove what caused one afternoon of déjà vu. They do show that remembered fragments from different periods and anticipated futures can appear together in a dream report.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .memory-set {
    margin-block: 2.7rem !important;
    padding: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgb(85 234 219 / 0.34);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 10%, rgb(255 94 203 / 0.15), transparent 30%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, #0b0b1b, #160b22);
    box-shadow: 0.65rem 0.72rem 0 rgb(4 2 10 / 0.3);
  }

  header span,
  .memory-set__result small {
    color: #55eadb;
    font: 750 0.62rem/1.3 var(--font-mono), monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  header h3 {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 1rem;
    color: #fff;
    font: 650 clamp(1.15rem, 3vw, 1.65rem)/1.15 var(--font-display), Georgia, serif;
  }

  .memory-set__fragments {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .memory-set__fragments span {
    padding: 0.48rem 0.6rem;
    color: #ded8e2;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.14);
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.04);
    font: 650 0.68rem/1.2 var(--font-mono), monospace;
    transform: translateY(calc((var(--i) % 3) * 0.08rem));
  }

  .memory-set__arrow {
    padding: 0.7rem 0 0.45rem;
    color: #ff5ecb;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .memory-set__result {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.24rem;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 94 203 / 0.4);
    background: rgb(6 5 14 / 0.68);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .memory-set__result strong {
    color: #fff;
    font: 650 1.02rem/1.25 var(--font-display), Georgia, serif;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin: 0.9rem 0 0 !important;
    color: #a89db1;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: left !important;
  }
</style>
